        "Title": "1001 Days",
        "Location": "LOCATION_MARRAKECH",
        "PublicId": "106431880984",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/marrakesh/_scene_spider.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository ca31c88f-d15e-407b-8407-231f1b068402).Image",
        "Description": "ChrisX3&#39;s completion of this spin in 4 minutes and 38 seconds during the Roulette Rivals World Championship 2021 was the longest standing map record in RR history, lasting 1001 days, before being beaten by Scruffy.\r\rHis completion also featured an interesting strategy frequently used in Roulette, sending both targets across the map by activating Honeycomb for Claus Strandberg and bringing Reza Zeydan over to the consulate by using an emetic on both another NPC and himself.\r\rTry to figure out how to do it, or use a completely different method, the choice is yours.",
